{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "辣度沟通不同屏案例", "content": "讲师与丈夫因对“辣”的定义不同而产生沟通问题。讲师是重庆人，认为食物不辣；丈夫是广东人，吃后觉得非常辣并生气。后来讲师调整沟通方式，说明“我觉得不辣，有可能对你辣，你自己判断”，并提醒丈夫自己对辣的理解不同。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["沟通案例", "辣度", "不同屏"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-44590c57ff06-c001:a004", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-44590c57ff06", "blocks": ["b00005", "b00006"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-44590c57ff06-c001:a003", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "“辣度沟通不同屏案例”展示了夫妻双方对“辣”理解不同导致的沟通问题，是“错误沟通方式：不同屏”的具体实例。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-44590c57ff06-c001:u0004"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
